================================================================================
Source:  https://github.com/ThePBone/RootlessJamesDSP (wrapper app GPL-3.0)
Engine:  https://github.com/ThePBone/JamesDSPManager, branch extensions,
         commit 1b9f89dbd4b332a07724beb41d58bc2ffcb05395
License: GPL-2.0 (full text at app/src/main/cpp/jamesdsp/LICENSE)

BitChord vendors libjamesdsp's DSP engine under
app/src/main/cpp/jamesdsp/libjamesdsp, plus the adjacent cpthread.c/.h.
BitChord does not vendor Rootless JamesDSP's AudioRecord capture service,
AudioEffect session wrapper, UI, or live-programming front end.

The JNI shim app/src/main/cpp/jamesdsp/jni/JamesDspJni.cpp and the Kotlin
integration (JamesDspProcessor, JamesDspNative, JamesDspSheet) are original
BitChord code. The engine runs in-process on BitChord's already-decoded
Float32 playback stream, so no root and no other apps' audio are involved.

Compatibility note: BitChord is GPLv3, and GPLv2-only code cannot simply be
combined into a GPLv3 work. This engine is included in early-access test
artifacts while that gate is resolved; see OVERHAUL_PLAN.md Workstream A1.
Do not treat the integration as cleared for a public release.
See app/src/main/cpp/jamesdsp/NOTICE.md for scope and update notes.
